codex
The paired comparison is weak so far: on 47 identical LFM3 task instances, FT adds two successes and loses none, with exact McNemar p = 0.50. One task was excluded because its timestamp-based folder name changed despite the same seed.

The training-data check found no episode overlap across train, validation, and test at the recorded Hub revision. Validation loss decreases for both models. The retention scores reproduce, but their confidence intervals support a narrower claim than “no forgetting.”
